{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "四种验证方式",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 120.24,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "验证的方式，大致有四种。差别在于，你信任谁。",
   "spoken": "验证的方式，大致有四种。差别在于，你信任谁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.576
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "第一种，外部多签，或者 MPC。",
   "spoken": "第一种，外部多签，或者 MPC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 5.98,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 6.082,
   "speechEnd": 9.093
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "一组验证者，凑够门限个签名，就放行。",
   "spoken": "一组验证者，凑够门限个签名，就放行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 9.56,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 9.56,
   "speechEnd": 12.852
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "你信任的是这些签名人。风险是私钥泄露，验证者共谋，或者门限太低。",
   "spoken": "你信任的是这些签名人。风险是私钥泄露，验证者共谋，或者门限太低。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 13.3,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 13.3,
   "speechEnd": 20.197
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "Ronin 就是这一种。",
   "spoken": "Ronin 就是这一种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 20.64,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 20.734,
   "speechEnd": 21.94
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第二种，轻客户端，也叫原生证明。",
   "spoken": "第二种，轻客户端，也叫原生证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 22.38,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 22.474,
   "speechEnd": 25.892
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "B 链上的合约，自己验证 A 链的区块头和证明。",
   "spoken": "B 链上的合约，自己验证 A 链的区块头和证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 26.28,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 26.39,
   "speechEnd": 30.172
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "你信任的是 A 链的共识，加上这段证明验证代码。",
   "spoken": "你信任的是 A 链的共识，加上这段证明验证代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 30.58,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 30.676,
   "speechEnd": 34.71
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "代码有漏洞，证明就能伪造。2022 年的 BNB Chain Token Hub，属于这一种。",
   "spoken": "代码有漏洞，证明就能伪造。2022 年的 BNB Chain Token Hub，属于这一种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 35.12,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 35.12,
   "speechEnd": 41.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "第三种，乐观证明。",
   "spoken": "第三种，乐观证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 41.42,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 41.42,
   "speechEnd": 43.176
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "消息默认有效，但留出一段挑战期。这期间，任何人都可以提交欺诈证明推翻它。",
   "spoken": "消息默认有效，但留出一段挑战期。这期间，任何人都可以提交欺诈证明推翻它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 43.64,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 43.64,
   "speechEnd": 50.112
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "你只需要一个诚实的挑战者。风险是挑战期里没人盯着，或者挑战者被审查。",
   "spoken": "你只需要一个诚实的挑战者。风险是挑战期里没人盯着，或者挑战者被审查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 50.5,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 50.593,
   "speechEnd": 57.705
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "多数乐观 Rollup 的原生桥，用的是这一种。",
   "spoken": "多数乐观 Rollup 的原生桥，用的是这一种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 58.16,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 58.256,
   "speechEnd": 61.196
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "第四种，零知识证明。",
   "spoken": "第四种，零知识证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 61.58,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 61.58,
   "speechEnd": 63.546
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "用数学证明 A 链的状态变化是正确的，不用逐条核对账本。",
   "spoken": "用数学证明 A 链的状态变化是正确的，不用逐条核对账本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 63.96,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 63.96,
   "speechEnd": 68.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "你信任的是数学，加上证明系统的实现和可信设置。电路或验证器写错，一样会出事。",
   "spoken": "你信任的是数学，加上证明系统的实现和可信设置。电路或验证器写错，一样会出事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 68.66,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 68.751,
   "speechEnd": 76.417
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "再猜一道题。一座 ZK 桥，证明系统完全正确，但桥合约可以被一个多签无延迟升级。",
   "spoken": "再猜一道题。一座 ZK 桥，证明系统完全正确，但桥合约可以被一个多签无延迟升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 76.88,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 76.88,
   "speechEnd": 84.49
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "用户只需要信任数学吗？",
   "spoken": "用户只需要信任数学吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 84.94,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 84.94,
   "speechEnd": 86.737
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "不是。多签可以把桥合约换成新实现，绕过证明系统。",
   "spoken": "不是。多签可以把桥合约换成新实现，绕过证明系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 87.44,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 87.536,
   "speechEnd": 92.342
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "用户同时信任证明系统，和升级权限的持有人。",
   "spoken": "用户同时信任证明系统，和升级权限的持有人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 92.78,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 92.78,
   "speechEnd": 96.463
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "按 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年的页面，Mantle 用的是 OP Succinct 有效性证明。",
   "spoken": "按 L2BEAT 截至 2026 年的页面，Mantle 用的是 OP Succinct 有效性证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 96.92,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 97.018,
   "speechEnd": 103.019
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "但它的输出预言机，可以由工程多签切换到乐观模式。桥合约可以由安全多签无延迟升级。",
   "spoken": "但它的输出预言机，可以由工程多签切换到乐观模式。桥合约可以由安全多签无延迟升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-21.wav",
   "start": 103.46,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 103.556,
   "speechEnd": 111.516
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "L2 的原生桥，也是一座跨链桥。它的安全，取决于证明系统和升级权限两样。",
   "spoken": "L2 的原生桥，也是一座跨链桥。它的安全，取决于证明系统和升级权限两样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg3-22.wav",
   "start": 111.92,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 112.02,
   "speechEnd": 118.808
  }
 ],
